usage: build_spatial_view_vae_cache.py [-h] --dataset-root DATASET_ROOT
                                       [--task TASK] [--episode EPISODE]
                                       --weights WEIGHTS
                                       [--expected-weights-sha256 EXPECTED_WEIGHTS_SHA256]
                                       [--cosmos-root COSMOS_ROOT]
                                       [--device DEVICE] [--height HEIGHT]
                                       [--width WIDTH]
                                       [--interpolation {lanczos,bilinear,nearest}]
                                       [--storage-dtype {float32,float16,bfloat16}]
                                       [--batch-size BATCH_SIZE] [--resume]
                                       [--view-first]
                                       [--spool-root SPOOL_ROOT]
                                       (--dry-run | --execute)

Plan or explicitly build independent G2 spatial-View Encode1 caches. Run from
the PSM-WMA root with ``python -m tools.g2.build_spatial_view_vae_cache``.
Planning hashes local dependencies and PNG owners but never instantiates a
VAE. Real encoding is a separate, explicitly selected action, not authorized
by the Issue52 code/CPU implementation itself.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --dataset-root DATASET_ROOT
                        existing G2 root containing
                        tasks/<task>/episodes/episode_<id>
  --task TASK           repeat to select task classes; omitted means all
  --episode EPISODE     repeat to select global episode IDs
  --weights WEIGHTS     existing local Wan VAE weight file; never downloaded
  --expected-weights-sha256 EXPECTED_WEIGHTS_SHA256
                        optional expected fingerprint, checked before any
                        encoding
  --cosmos-root COSMOS_ROOT
                        local fixed Cosmos checkout; default is Root/cosmos-
                        framework
  --device DEVICE       cpu, cuda or cuda:<index>; dry-run does not initialize
                        it
  --height HEIGHT       candidate canvas height, not a production
                        configuration freeze
  --width WIDTH         candidate canvas width, not a production configuration
                        freeze
  --interpolation {lanczos,bilinear,nearest}
  --storage-dtype {float32,float16,bfloat16}
                        FP32 is the initial baseline; low precision requires
                        its own real Gate
  --batch-size BATCH_SIZE
                        this candidate supports B=1 only; mixed-batch real
                        parity is NOT_RUN
  --resume              reuse only complete per-view files with identical
                        source and recipe
  --view-first          explicit posthoc lifecycle; original published View
                        profile remains unchanged
  --spool-root SPOOL_ROOT
                        new external bounded posthoc record spool; required
                        for View-first execute
  --dry-run, --plan     report every valid View/owner/ref and output path; do
                        not create cache
  --execute             actually encode; use only after separate real-VAE
                        execution authorization
